msgid ""
"For a senior-level interview, you should go beyond 'components + global "
"store'. Talk about module boundaries (feature-based folders, domain-driven "
"slices), isolated design systems, clear contracts between API and UI, and "
"how you avoid tight coupling. Mention decisions around routing, "
"data-fetching strategy (for example React Query or SWR), error handling, "
"and how you'd support gradual refactors or micro-frontend approaches. This "
"shows you think like an architect, not just an implementer."
msgstr ""
"För en intervju på seniornivå bör du gå längre än 'komponenter + global "
"butik'. Prata om modulgränser (funktionbaserade mappar, domänstyrda "
"skivor), isolerade designsystem, tydliga kontrakter mellan API och UI, och "
"hur du undviker hård koppling. Nämn beslut kring routing, "
"dataintagningsstrategi (till exempel React Query eller SWR), felhantering, "
"och hur du skulle stödja gradvisa omstruktureringar eller "
"mikrofrontend-ansatser. Detta visar att du tänker som en arkitekt, inte "
"bara som en implementerare."

